{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-05-10 16:30:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK TO HOST HEALTHCARE AND MEGATREND UPDATE CALL ON MAY 11, 2023 AT 2:00PM ET', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BLACKROCK ADVISORS, LLC (“BLACKROCK”) WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL ON THURSDAY, MAY 11, 2023 AT 2:00PM ET FEATURING ERIN XIE, HEAD OF THE HEALTH SCIENCES TEAM AND PORTFOLIO MANAGER, AND TITANIA HANRAHAN, HEAD OF SECTOR & MEGATREND PRODUCT STRATEGY. ERIN AND TITANIA WILL DISCUSS MEGATRENDS IMPACTING THE HEALTHCARE INVESTING ENVIRONMENT AND HIGHLIGHT THE FOLLOWING FUNDS (THE “FUNDS”): BLACKROCK HEALTH SCIENCES TERM TRUST (BMEZ)1, BLACKROCK HEALTH SCIENCES TRUST (BME).'}